     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>R version 4 was released at <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483765164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3P3WfTByeBu1XfMNAOosB-\">https://cran.r-project.org</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve built R/qtl2 binaries for R v4. When you upgrade R, update your R/qtl2 packages:<br></div><div><br></div><div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">  update.packages(repos=&quot;<a href=\"https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483765164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3x2MHDxb9GNjr1kRMLw1oS\">https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran</a>&quot;, ask=FALSE, checkBuilt=TRUE)</span></div><div><br></div><div>Or install again from scratch:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">  install.packages(&quot;qtl2&quot;, repos=&quot;<a href=\"https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483765164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3x2MHDxb9GNjr1kRMLw1oS\">https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran</a>&quot;)</span></div><div><br></div><div>karl<br></div></div></div>"
